{
  "name": "Brutal Beating",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take the Attack action and use your Sneak Attack, you can immediately make another attack. If the target is suffering from a condition, you can add half your Sneak Attack dice (rounded down) to that attack.</p><p>You also learn the following new way to use your Sneak Attack:</p><ul><li><strong>Stun (Cost: 6d6).</strong> The target has to make a Constitution Saving Throw or become Stunned until the end of your next turn.</li></ul>",
